67aa5))(text "R1208 是 6mA 级泄放，不是制动电阻。功率切断不等于母线瞬间归零，也不能吸收持续回灌。" (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid 9a77f4bb-e3cc-5372-ab3c-d41f13c8cc50))(text "反向阻断会使回灌留在 HEAD_VM：吸收/输出过压见15–16页，瞬态未验证，禁止接舵机运行。" (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 165319bf-603c-5e49-9eb0-4eef4321956f))(hierarchical_label "HEAD_6V_RAW" (shape bidirectional) (at 27.94 69.85 180.0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify right)) (uuid fa63ae55-736e-5ccb-a880-6d2bf01bdf66))(hierarchical_label "HEAD_VM" (shape bidirectional) (at 398.78 69.85 0.0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid b3ee4ae1-8ee2-57a1-81b0-7ff7e2562c0e))(hierarchical_label "ARMED" (shape bidirectional) (at 143.51 87.63 180.0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify right)) (uuid e197c487-4aba-593d-b8ac-d9b7e6ddcdba)))